<p>You deliberately fire a missing shot at a target, startling it for 3 turns.</p><p>If the target fails a mental save it instinctively recoils two steps back.</p><p>The next shot that hits the startled creature will deal <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">217%, 244%, 266%, 284%, 300%</acronym> more damage.</p>